    "text": "<math><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi></math>  of  <math><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.61</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi></math>  of  <math><mi>B</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.57</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi></math>  of  <math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.04</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi>E</mi><mi>N</mi></math>  of  <math><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.55</mn></math> <br/><br/>Due to diagonal relationship between  <math><mi>B</mi><mi>e</mi></math>  and  <math><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>,</mo></math>  they exhibit similar properties and thus, have similar electronegativity values."
